From a0ea340a1795be9a8e3776cfbedd6b653390223a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:25:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] nm-sim: read foreign definitions only through their
 published lemmas

Seal findings: AllOutputs/CostBoundedBy are read through allOutputs_pure,
allOutputs_query and costBoundedBy_query; NMSecure through NMSecure_iff;
ofPolyTime's coins through coins_ofPolyTime; rImpl through rImpl_some; finSt's
polynomial-time bound is published by Simulator. Recover drops two slow
congr steps.
